From 523777b18ae312f746d19ee5494bc46406f9e812 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Matthew Hiltner <matthew.e.hiltner@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 24 Jul 2026 13:20:07 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 3/4] clutter/offscreen-effect: Preserve framebuffer pixel
 phase

Fractional resource scales require offscreen targets to retain the source framebuffer's pixel phase. Size and position the target from phase-aware pixel bounds, repaint when the phase changes, and use linear filtering when exact texel alignment cannot be guaranteed.

A phase change can also change the offscreen target dimensions without changing the actor allocation. Invalidate deform-effect geometry when that target size changes and cover the transition with a conform test.
