 clutter/clutter/clutter-deform-effect.c       |  20 +-
 clutter/clutter/clutter-offscreen-effect.c    | 303 +++++++++++++++---
 .../conform/actor-offscreen-redirect.c        | 131 +++++++-
 3 files changed, 415 insertions(+), 39 deletions(-)

