Subject: [PATCH 4/4] tests/stage-view: Compare fractional offscreen rendering

Exercise a no-op offscreen effect on a 4/3-scale virtual stage view whose origin has a repeating-third device-pixel phase. Compare the complete framebuffer byte-for-byte with the direct paint path at initial, horizontal, vertical, and diagonal positions.

The test fails with the previous nearest-filtered implementation and passes once the source framebuffer phase is preserved.
